WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
I'm sure I'll make a lot of money

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:02,640
Know Huo Yuan

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,400
You can earn at least several hundred more a day

4
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,820
Why are you calling Masandao?

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,800
