9
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:30,080
Something happened when the packaging said "Super Coffee" was sold.

10
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:32,040
Of course someone will take the blame for us

11
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:38,860
Is Ling Yu here?

12
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:40,890
What do you want from my brother?
